WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.197
Ask FairMind answers questions from your own systems and records.

2
00:00:08.285 --> 00:00:12.616
It uses the AI provider your organisation configured in Settings.

3
00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:23.866
Once a provider is on, you type a question or pick a suggestion, and the answer links to the systems it names.
